Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Remove context menu for files
[-HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Classes\*\shell\OpenWithZed]

; Remove context menu for directories
[-HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Classes\Directory\shell\OpenWithZed]

; Remove context menu for background/empty space
[-HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Classes\Directory\background\shell\OpenWithZed]